WEBVTT

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:20.390
Cuticle Detective Inaba

00:01:35.390 --> 00:01:36.150
All done.

00:01:36.840 --> 00:01:38.740
Yay!

00:01:38.740 --> 00:01:40.690
I did it! I did it!

00:01:41.660 --> 00:01:43.850
Thank you! Thank you!

00:01:43.850 --> 00:01:45.840
Thank you! Th—

00:01:47.230 --> 00:01:49.720
Say something if you're standing there!

00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:54.430
Take a look at my latest elite life-form.

00:01:55.290 --> 00:01:56.300
Well, then...

00:01:56.990 --> 00:01:59.600
What should I make next?

00:02:01.470 --> 00:02:05.270
Meeting Room

00:02:06.280 --> 00:02:07.270
Noah?

00:02:07.400 --> 00:02:09.940
The head of the Valentino
Family's Medical Department.

00:02:10.170 --> 00:02:11.190
She's a back-alley doctor.

00:02:11.700 --> 00:02:15.280
She is a fourteen-year-old girl,
but unmistakably a genius.

00:02:16.330 --> 00:02:20.440
Her specialty is inventions, and she's
also called a witch and an alchemist.

00:02:21.290 --> 00:02:23.350
It can be said that she's
the one supporting

00:02:23.350 --> 00:02:24.620
the Valentino Family from the shadows.

00:02:25.490 --> 00:02:27.780
That goat seems to
produce a lot of things.

00:02:27.780 --> 00:02:29.130
Is that all her doing?

00:02:29.130 --> 00:02:29.620
Yes.

00:02:30.780 --> 00:02:33.120
She's a terrifying young
girl who is able to bring

00:02:33.120 --> 00:02:34.540
all of Valentino's delusions to life.

00:02:35.090 --> 00:02:37.390
If they were going to take over Japan,

00:02:37.390 --> 00:02:38.840
she would be indispensable.

00:02:39.470 --> 00:02:41.380
Actually, if Noah wasn't present,

00:02:41.380 --> 00:02:42.800
the Family's threat would
be reduced to half.

00:02:43.060 --> 00:02:45.690
They'd be reduced to a mere
goat adoration group.

00:02:45.690 --> 00:02:47.340
That's a pretty drastic drop!

00:02:47.340 --> 00:02:49.170
Should we be saying that
about our arch-nemesis?!

00:02:49.170 --> 00:02:50.710
You might consider them
some adoration group,

00:02:50.710 --> 00:02:51.640
but they're still rather extreme.

00:02:51.640 --> 00:02:52.650
Are you tired, Ogi-san?

00:02:53.060 --> 00:02:55.730
So, do you know where this Noah is?

00:02:56.430 --> 00:02:57.150
Yeah.

00:02:57.640 --> 00:02:59.910
Apparently, whenever she
invents something,

00:02:59.910 --> 00:03:01.200
she hides out there by herself.

00:03:01.750 --> 00:03:03.590
I'd like to apprehend her
before she unleashes another

00:03:03.590 --> 00:03:05.200
dangerous threat from
the Valentino Family.

00:03:05.730 --> 00:03:06.890
Let's go, Hiroshi.

00:03:07.230 --> 00:03:07.780
Right.

00:03:10.650 --> 00:03:11.290
Huh?!

00:03:11.660 --> 00:03:12.540
What?

00:03:12.760 --> 00:03:14.980
I expected you to turn me down like always.

00:03:14.980 --> 00:03:17.240
Inaba-san is finally being true to himself.

00:03:17.240 --> 00:03:18.200
Are you going soft?

00:03:18.200 --> 00:03:19.560
No, I'm not,

00:03:19.560 --> 00:03:21.840
and I'm always true to myself
and act accordingly!

00:03:22.150 --> 00:03:24.880
I really don't want anything
to do with that goat,

00:03:24.880 --> 00:03:27.850
but I don't know how else to find
Haruka, so I don't have a choice.

00:03:28.480 --> 00:03:30.560
I'm glad you're being cooperative,

00:03:30.560 --> 00:03:32.440
but there are definitely
some mixed feelings.

00:03:33.050 --> 00:03:35.060
Oh, you.

00:03:36.190 --> 00:03:37.520
Would you rather drag me along

00:03:37.520 --> 00:03:39.820
by force, kicking and screaming?
You've got good taste.

00:03:39.820 --> 00:03:42.180
I'll resist with all my might
today, just for you.

00:03:42.720 --> 00:03:45.120
I was just trying to be
sympathetic to your situation,

00:03:45.120 --> 00:03:47.490
but if that's how you want to be,
I'll put all my might into this, as well.

00:03:47.490 --> 00:03:49.080
Inaba-san, your neck's gonna snap!

00:03:49.470 --> 00:03:52.210
This might be immature since we're
dealing with a fourteen-year-old girl,

00:03:52.210 --> 00:03:54.410
but I'm going to show her the
real Cuticle Detective.

00:03:54.740 --> 00:03:56.850
The "let us get rid of the
weakling" declaration.

00:03:56.850 --> 00:03:58.590
So where is Noah, exactly?

00:03:59.390 --> 00:04:00.950
Well, she is a back-alley doctor,

00:04:00.950 --> 00:04:02.000
so obviously...

00:04:03.440 --> 00:04:04.550
She's at a hospital.

00:04:06.970 --> 00:04:09.100
Show me what you're made of, Hiroshi.

00:04:09.100 --> 00:04:11.190
Hell no! I'm not going
into a hospital at night!

00:04:11.190 --> 00:04:12.610
We'd be disturbing the patients!

00:04:12.610 --> 00:04:14.880
Not to worry. It is a completely
abandoned hospital.

00:04:14.880 --> 00:04:16.610
That's even worse!

00:04:16.830 --> 00:04:18.940
It'll be fine. I brought a light.

00:04:18.940 --> 00:04:21.170
What you guys consider fine
doesn't help me at all!

00:04:21.800 --> 00:04:24.320
If you're that scared,
I'll hold your hand.

00:04:24.710 --> 00:04:25.350
Kei...

00:04:25.610 --> 00:04:26.340
Shake

00:04:26.340 --> 00:04:27.920
You're scared, too, aren't you?
Shake

00:04:27.920 --> 00:04:29.080
Yes.
Shake

00:04:30.660 --> 00:04:31.970
We're going.

00:04:41.780 --> 00:04:42.670
Be quiet.

00:04:44.520 --> 00:04:47.470
It's a trap to scare off people
who come in here on a dare.

00:04:47.700 --> 00:04:50.110
They're probably set up
all over the place.

00:04:50.530 --> 00:04:51.420
Be careful.

00:04:51.420 --> 00:04:52.370
W-Wait!

00:04:54.250 --> 00:04:57.490
It is, it is, indeed it is.

00:04:58.120 --> 00:04:59.090
Goat!

00:04:59.090 --> 00:04:59.940
Wolf!

00:05:00.220 --> 00:05:02.600
Why do you always show up when
we're not looking for you?

00:05:02.600 --> 00:05:04.210
We're looking for Noah today.

00:05:04.210 --> 00:05:06.200
If you're unable to read the air,
then you shouldn't be breathing it.

00:05:06.520 --> 00:05:07.480
Should I arrest you?

00:05:07.480 --> 00:05:09.910
Shut up! Like I care
about why you're here!

00:05:10.230 --> 00:05:13.330
Get out already!
This is Noah's private space!

00:05:13.330 --> 00:05:15.460
You will not disturb Noah's
work, you will not!

00:05:15.460 --> 00:05:17.880
So this is the genius
girl's studio, of sorts?

00:05:18.430 --> 00:05:20.670
If you're here by yourself,
that's even better for us.

00:05:20.670 --> 00:05:23.090
I don't see Lorenzo or
Streaked Hair anywhere.

00:05:25.980 --> 00:05:27.470
Capturing the goat!

00:05:32.130 --> 00:05:32.910
Well done!

00:05:32.910 --> 00:05:33.600
Over there!

00:05:33.600 --> 00:05:35.930
Head toward the security
robots, you shall!

00:05:36.390 --> 00:05:37.280
Ow...

00:05:37.280 --> 00:05:38.670
Are you all right, Inaba-san?

00:05:38.670 --> 00:05:40.690
If Glasses is here, that means...

00:05:41.380 --> 00:05:42.440
Hold it right there!

00:05:42.440 --> 00:05:43.280
Hey, you guys!

00:05:46.820 --> 00:05:48.820
That security robot is super scary!

00:05:48.820 --> 00:05:51.080
Intruder alert. Intruder alert.

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:53.150
Transport immediately
for emergency surgery!

00:05:53.900 --> 00:05:54.590
Hiroshi!

00:05:54.590 --> 00:05:55.660
Scary!

00:05:57.030 --> 00:05:57.620
Wha...

00:06:01.840 --> 00:06:02.390
Don't...

00:06:03.860 --> 00:06:05.670
Perv robots! Perv robots!

00:06:08.220 --> 00:06:10.190
Now I can never get married...

00:06:12.790 --> 00:06:14.350
Well, you're healthy.

00:06:15.460 --> 00:06:16.810
Did you get excited?

00:06:16.810 --> 00:06:18.390
Your heart rate is through the roof.

00:06:18.730 --> 00:06:22.880
Look at this color, this shine, the firmness...
Young bodies are fabulous.

00:06:22.880 --> 00:06:24.870
What the hell is up with this
sexual harrassment girl?!

00:06:24.870 --> 00:06:26.670
Noah! That is the wolf, that is!

00:06:26.670 --> 00:06:27.860
Hurry and kill him!

00:06:27.860 --> 00:06:28.320
Goat!
Hurry and kill him!

00:06:28.720 --> 00:06:29.570
Nope.

00:06:30.140 --> 00:06:32.150
Werewolves are rare animals.

00:06:32.150 --> 00:06:33.660
Of course I'm going to
skin him, observe him,

00:06:33.660 --> 00:06:34.960
research him, and experiment on him!

00:06:34.960 --> 00:06:36.790
There's no way I'd be so
wasteful and kill him!

00:06:37.160 --> 00:06:40.000
You don't know me at all, Don!
First time I ever saw one of
the minions defy the goat...

00:06:40.430 --> 00:06:43.390
Not to mention, this wolf's eyes are tired.

00:06:43.390 --> 00:06:44.720
He's not getting enough sleep.

00:06:44.720 --> 00:06:45.800
This is no good.

00:06:45.800 --> 00:06:47.630
He has to be in perfect condition...

00:06:47.630 --> 00:06:49.590
A healthy body and soul...

00:06:49.590 --> 00:06:52.550
The vitality to live through an ice age...

00:06:52.550 --> 00:06:54.460
It's best if something
that great dies young!

00:06:54.460 --> 00:06:56.270
You just don't understand the
allure of such contrasts, Don!

00:06:56.270 --> 00:06:58.770
Take that ultimate contrast
obsession elsewhere!

00:06:58.770 --> 00:06:59.200
Anyway, kill the wolf, you will!

00:06:59.200 --> 00:07:01.040
Hey, Haruka's with you, right?
Where is he?
Anyway, kill the wolf, you will!

00:07:01.040 --> 00:07:01.760
No! I don't wanna!
Hey, Haruka's with you, right?
Where is he?

00:07:01.760 --> 00:07:01.770
Kill him! Kill him! Kill him!

00:07:01.770 --> 00:07:02.470
No! I don't wanna!

00:07:03.220 --> 00:07:03.230
No!

00:07:03.230 --> 00:07:04.120
Oh, thanks...

00:07:04.120 --> 00:07:04.670
No!

00:07:04.670 --> 00:07:05.520
Wait a sec!

00:07:05.520 --> 00:07:07.810
The weakling rabbit passed
out from heat stroke

00:07:07.810 --> 00:07:09.240
and is at death's doorstep.

00:07:09.580 --> 00:07:11.120
While we're treating him at my place,

00:07:11.120 --> 00:07:13.000
I've made Glasses there my assistant.

00:07:13.320 --> 00:07:15.130
He's a good assistant who
lacks any presence and

00:07:15.130 --> 00:07:16.420
doesn't get distracted.

00:07:16.420 --> 00:07:19.250
Also, I just came by to visit him.

00:07:19.770 --> 00:07:22.250
I'm so sorry my brother has
caused so much trouble...

00:07:22.760 --> 00:07:24.210
I wondered a couple times if I should
call you since you're his family.

00:07:24.210 --> 00:07:26.210
Take care of NORA for me...

00:07:26.210 --> 00:07:28.170
Hang in there, Haruka-san!
You should have called me!
Actually, just give him back!

00:07:28.410 --> 00:07:31.110
Of course I'll return him
good as new and healthy!

00:07:31.110 --> 00:07:32.630
Thank you, Doctor!

00:07:33.310 --> 00:07:33.970
Hiroshi!

00:07:35.570 --> 00:07:36.540
What are you doing?

00:07:36.540 --> 00:07:39.090
Your timing may have sucked
a little there...

00:07:39.090 --> 00:07:42.140
Don't worry... my heart is
the heart of justice...

00:07:42.520 --> 00:07:45.110
Long arms and legs to go along
with his tall stature...

00:07:45.440 --> 00:07:48.940
Defined muscles that are obvious
even with his clothes on...

00:07:49.160 --> 00:07:52.030
That bone structure...
That complexion...

00:07:52.210 --> 00:07:52.470
Such a healthy body!

00:07:52.470 --> 00:07:54.240
Swoon
Such a healthy body!

00:07:54.480 --> 00:07:55.770
I totally want to kill him!

00:07:55.770 --> 00:07:57.990
And Noah's flame has been lit!

00:07:58.180 --> 00:07:59.660
I totally want to help!

00:07:59.660 --> 00:08:02.120
Crap! The flame's been
ignited in our genius, too!

00:08:02.120 --> 00:08:05.030
I can barely stand it! I wonder if
he'll let me take an MRI of him?

00:08:05.030 --> 00:08:07.340
You should draw his blood, too.
About five liters of it.

00:08:07.590 --> 00:08:08.750
I want to measure his lung capacity
before I stop his breathing.
Assistant...

00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:10.510
Yuuta-kun, come back.
That's the enemy's side...

00:08:13.180 --> 00:08:15.970
You totally heard me!
Don't conveniently put me on mute!

00:08:16.250 --> 00:08:19.060
I thought I'd be satisfied
with just arresting Noah,

00:08:19.470 --> 00:08:22.220
but it appears the day has come that
I can arrest the assistant, too.

00:08:22.550 --> 00:08:23.980
He's on fire, too...

00:08:24.490 --> 00:08:25.480
Faint

00:08:26.180 --> 00:08:27.820
He's getting so hot...

00:08:27.820 --> 00:08:30.820
Thinking about him getting
under 27 degrees just gets me...

00:08:32.410 --> 00:08:33.490
This is hard...

00:08:34.370 --> 00:08:37.310
I've heard about the strong police man.

00:08:37.310 --> 00:08:40.270
Looks like it's time I bring out
my newest creation, Chimera.

00:08:40.270 --> 00:08:41.040
Chimera?!

00:08:41.450 --> 00:08:43.570
It's only natural that creating
a new life-form comes after

00:08:43.570 --> 00:08:45.320
creating new medicines and
building new machines.

00:08:45.320 --> 00:08:46.470
They're said to have
the head of a lion,

00:08:46.470 --> 00:08:49.750
the body of a goat,
and the tail of a snake,

00:08:50.080 --> 00:08:52.680
but this Chimera is my own original.

00:08:52.680 --> 00:08:53.260
Behold!

00:08:54.860 --> 00:08:55.840
The body of a goat!

00:08:55.840 --> 00:08:57.090
The tail of a goat!

00:08:57.090 --> 00:08:58.350
The head of a goat!

00:08:59.200 --> 00:09:01.490
Oh no! It's just a normal goat!

00:09:02.850 --> 00:09:06.030
It has the stomach of a cow, the heart
of a pig, and the intestines of a sheep.

00:09:06.030 --> 00:09:07.020
We can't see any of that!

00:09:07.020 --> 00:09:08.640
It doesn't contain any part
of a carnivore anywhere!

00:09:08.640 --> 00:09:09.650
And why no cat representation?!

00:09:10.080 --> 00:09:12.400
Even I can beat this goat!

00:09:15.530 --> 00:09:16.610
Holy crap, it's strong!

00:09:16.610 --> 00:09:18.320
This goat should be the Don!

00:09:18.910 --> 00:09:20.350
His hooves were hard...

00:09:20.350 --> 00:09:22.410
Those are the lamest last words ever...

00:09:23.410 --> 00:09:26.080
There's no way that Ogi-san
should lose, but...

00:09:28.130 --> 00:09:28.400
Kill Him.

00:09:28.400 --> 00:09:32.840
Kill him! Kill him!
Soak your hooves in his blood!
Kill Him.

00:09:35.460 --> 00:09:36.940
I forgot to mention this,

00:09:36.940 --> 00:09:38.720
but the inside of his mouth
is a poisonous snake.

00:09:39.130 --> 00:09:41.740
Really? Is it a neurotoxin
or a hemorrhagin?

00:09:41.740 --> 00:09:42.980
I was torn between the two,

00:09:42.980 --> 00:09:45.180
but between a pit viper and a
cobra, it's gotta be a cobra.

00:09:45.850 --> 00:09:48.110
The one that causes difficulty breathing, eh?

00:09:48.110 --> 00:09:50.940
It's such a girly picture,
but your conversation is literally poison.

00:09:50.940 --> 00:09:51.690
Patooie

00:09:51.900 --> 00:09:52.520
Stab

00:09:52.770 --> 00:09:54.750
Ooh, what kind of poison was that?

00:09:54.750 --> 00:09:57.150
I only have sleeping medicine...

00:09:57.390 --> 00:09:57.690
Oh, don't worry about it.

00:09:57.690 --> 00:09:59.370
You'll pay for this, assistant.
Oh, don't worry about it.

00:10:01.310 --> 00:10:02.160
Ogi!

00:10:02.560 --> 00:10:04.040
Chomp

00:10:05.410 --> 00:10:07.040
Inaba-san! Inaba-san!

00:10:07.360 --> 00:10:09.330
Maybe it's because I put a bit
of your blood in it, Don,

00:10:09.330 --> 00:10:10.670
but his hatred toward the wolf is powerful.

00:10:10.670 --> 00:10:11.600
When did you get that?!

00:10:11.980 --> 00:10:12.630
Sensei!

00:10:14.320 --> 00:10:15.520
Get a hold of yourself, Sensei!

00:10:15.520 --> 00:10:16.550
Yuuta...

00:10:16.840 --> 00:10:18.460
I'm so sorry, Sensei!

00:10:18.460 --> 00:10:22.050
I got so caught up in killing Ogi-san!

00:10:23.070 --> 00:10:24.780
To see you getting along with someone

00:10:24.780 --> 00:10:27.140
on the first meeting,
when you're usually so shy...

00:10:27.970 --> 00:10:30.240
I guess she's sort of your soulmate.

00:10:30.240 --> 00:10:31.410
Good for you.

00:10:32.500 --> 00:10:33.650
Sensei!

00:10:37.180 --> 00:10:39.120
The Chimera that was
poked by Yuuta-kun

00:10:39.120 --> 00:10:41.100
has turned into a gelatinous form...

00:10:41.100 --> 00:10:42.780
I don't think I should
bring that up right now.

00:10:43.640 --> 00:10:45.950
You have the antidote, right, Noah?

00:10:46.840 --> 00:10:49.250
But if I save the wolf,
the Don will start complaining.

00:10:50.050 --> 00:10:52.650
I think it'd be fun to be friends with you.

00:10:53.380 --> 00:10:54.890
But I can't go over to that side.

00:10:55.650 --> 00:10:59.690
Heal Sensei right now, or the Don gets it!

00:10:59.690 --> 00:11:02.170
That's the gelatin Chimera!

00:11:03.890 --> 00:11:05.030
Too bad, it is!

00:11:05.030 --> 00:11:08.390
I'm right here!
The wolf will die, he will!

00:11:09.800 --> 00:11:11.520
If the Don is a hostage,
I have no choice.

00:11:12.080 --> 00:11:13.110
Noah?!

00:11:13.710 --> 00:11:15.510
Wait one sec. I'll have it right up.

00:11:15.510 --> 00:11:16.900
Noah! Right here!

00:11:16.900 --> 00:11:18.760
What's precious to you is
always right beside y—

00:11:18.760 --> 00:11:19.560
You're in the way, Don.

00:11:20.470 --> 00:11:21.550
You just said "Don"!

00:11:21.550 --> 00:11:23.770
You totally just said "Don," Noah!

00:11:23.770 --> 00:11:26.370
Noah! You totally know that
I am right here, you do!

00:11:26.850 --> 00:11:32.540
Look over here, Noah! Noah! Noah!

00:11:33.650 --> 00:11:35.140
They got away.

00:11:35.770 --> 00:11:36.300
Yeah.

00:11:36.670 --> 00:11:39.780
But it's a good thing you and
Noah didn't join forces,

00:11:39.780 --> 00:11:41.220
for the sake of Japan's future.

00:11:41.690 --> 00:11:44.300
Don't worry. We're just going
to be texting buddies.

00:11:44.300 --> 00:11:46.080
You guys exchanged numbers?!

00:11:49.830 --> 00:11:52.870
What's this, Noah?
You're suddenly texting?

00:11:52.870 --> 00:11:54.360
Did you find yourself a man?

00:11:54.360 --> 00:11:55.680
Don't look, Sis!

00:11:55.680 --> 00:11:58.200
You should put in more
emoticons, you should.

00:11:58.200 --> 00:12:01.860
My, my, have you finally
reached that age, Noah?

00:12:02.850 --> 00:12:05.820
Everyone, leave me alone!

00:12:08.780 --> 00:12:11.790
The sky is clear!
The season is autumn!

00:12:12.280 --> 00:12:14.040
The perfect travel weather!

00:12:14.170 --> 00:12:19.750
Thus, "mafia and terrorist group joint
pleasure trip in Hakone," it is!

00:12:19.750 --> 00:12:21.510
This is great!

00:12:22.630 --> 00:12:26.510
Meeting Room

00:12:26.820 --> 00:12:30.080
If you eat a black egg, your life will
stretch another seven years, it will.

00:12:30.480 --> 00:12:32.230
You should eat one, too, you should.

00:12:32.230 --> 00:12:33.200
More importantly...

00:12:33.200 --> 00:12:36.090
give me oxygen... please...

00:12:36.090 --> 00:12:38.740
You can't handle the elevation
of Oowakudani, either?

00:12:38.960 --> 00:12:41.450
I didn't hear anything
about mountain climbing.

00:12:41.450 --> 00:12:43.550
Carry me, Natsuki...

00:12:43.550 --> 00:12:44.800
Your ghost is coming out, Haruka-san!

00:12:44.800 --> 00:12:46.800
Ooh! A paranormal picture!

00:12:46.800 --> 00:12:49.790
Paranormal pictures are best when
discovered a few days after the trip.

00:12:50.110 --> 00:12:53.280
I only came because you said we'd
be looking at the autumn leaves...

00:12:53.280 --> 00:12:55.850
To think that you'd come just
because of the autumn leaves.

00:12:55.850 --> 00:12:57.080
I am impressed, I am.

00:12:57.360 --> 00:13:00.520
Well, red things in general
look like Nii-ni to me.

00:13:00.520 --> 00:13:03.090
Nii-ni spread across the
mountains is fantastic.

00:13:03.090 --> 00:13:05.300
That's a terrible "brother
complex" filter, it is.

00:13:06.390 --> 00:13:07.790
The weakling has reached his limit,

00:13:07.790 --> 00:13:09.840
so let's head back to the inn.

00:13:10.230 --> 00:13:11.140
Okay!

00:13:11.490 --> 00:13:13.930
There are three young bodies today,

00:13:13.930 --> 00:13:15.930
so I can't wait to go
to the hot springs.

00:13:15.930 --> 00:13:19.770
Oh, so you're treating
me like an old hag?

00:13:19.770 --> 00:13:21.730
Hakone

00:13:22.300 --> 00:13:24.450
What a wonderful room!

00:13:24.890 --> 00:13:27.780
Wow! The view is great, too!

00:13:28.110 --> 00:13:29.470
This is great!

00:13:29.470 --> 00:13:30.940
Is it to your liking?

00:13:30.940 --> 00:13:31.540
It is.

00:13:32.020 --> 00:13:34.720
The feeling of not having
anything to do is great.

00:13:34.720 --> 00:13:36.920
I'm a pro at relaxing.

00:13:36.920 --> 00:13:39.420
You shine so brightly indoors.

00:13:39.420 --> 00:13:41.840
Hey, Natsu chick, the girls'
room is over here.

00:13:41.840 --> 00:13:43.690
We're changing. Hurry up.

00:13:43.690 --> 00:13:44.570
Okay!

00:13:44.920 --> 00:13:45.300
Whisper

00:13:45.300 --> 00:13:47.760
Wow! It's a yukata!
Whisper

00:13:49.100 --> 00:13:50.890
So, which one are you after?

00:13:50.890 --> 00:13:51.480
Huh?

00:13:51.480 --> 00:13:52.760
Don't play dumb.

00:13:52.760 --> 00:13:54.800
Are you after Weakling or Glasses?

00:13:54.800 --> 00:13:55.430
What?!

00:13:55.840 --> 00:13:58.030
Though both choices sort of suck.

00:13:58.030 --> 00:14:00.270
You're the last two I
need to hear that from.

00:14:01.030 --> 00:14:02.980
They're both my dear friends.

00:14:02.980 --> 00:14:05.360
I've never thought of either
of them in that way.

00:14:05.360 --> 00:14:09.320
You should totally go for Glasses.
He has a better body.

00:14:09.320 --> 00:14:12.180
The Weakling is better in size.

00:14:12.790 --> 00:14:14.390
I think he's about 166 centimeters.

00:14:14.390 --> 00:14:16.290
You're just going by your own types!

00:14:16.750 --> 00:14:19.070
Both of them are pretty shady, though.

00:14:19.070 --> 00:14:21.420
What are you talking about? One's a
gentleman and the other's a child.

00:14:23.450 --> 00:14:25.430
We can totally hear them.
Be more honest to yourself.

00:14:26.420 --> 00:14:28.060
You say gentleman...

00:14:28.440 --> 00:14:31.500
So, do his hopes and dreams
shine through his despair?

00:14:31.500 --> 00:14:33.550
What the heck is that
image of a gentleman?!

00:14:33.550 --> 00:14:35.930
He's just a standard gentleman who
carries heavy things, lends me

00:14:35.930 --> 00:14:38.440
his coat when it's cold, and always
walks on the outer side of the sidewalk.

00:14:39.030 --> 00:14:41.270
Yataro is a childhood friend.

00:14:42.320 --> 00:14:46.690
He's always taken good care of me,
and he's sort of like my big brother.

00:14:47.260 --> 00:14:49.450
Big brother? What a wonderful thing.

00:14:49.690 --> 00:14:52.410
Don't come in looking so proud,
you brother complex weakling.

00:14:59.460 --> 00:15:01.060
The gentleman just hit you.

00:15:01.060 --> 00:15:02.420
He's shy.

00:15:02.420 --> 00:15:04.290
He's rather hard to understand.

00:15:05.470 --> 00:15:07.400
Now for the main event of this trip.

00:15:07.400 --> 00:15:09.020
Let us go to the hot springs.

00:15:09.930 --> 00:15:12.010
I've already gone to bed.

00:15:12.010 --> 00:15:13.780
Have fun!

00:15:13.780 --> 00:15:16.020
Stop becoming one with the tatami.

00:15:16.430 --> 00:15:18.360
But... hot springs are so...

00:15:19.080 --> 00:15:20.410
hot.

00:15:20.410 --> 00:15:21.980
Curse you, Mr. Delicate!

00:15:21.980 --> 00:15:23.980
You will go to the hot springs, you will.

00:15:23.980 --> 00:15:25.240
You will wash off the smell of
blood and gunpowder, you will.

00:15:25.240 --> 00:15:27.940
No! I don't wanna!

00:15:28.380 --> 00:15:29.450
I don't get my hands dirty,
so I'm already clean!

00:15:29.450 --> 00:15:31.470
Hot springs! Hot springs!

00:15:31.470 --> 00:15:31.890
Your spirit is completely
black, it is.

00:15:31.890 --> 00:15:33.660
We're heading over.

00:15:33.660 --> 00:15:36.290
Women
Men

00:15:37.160 --> 00:15:39.330
Did Mr. Goat and the
others already head in?

00:15:39.330 --> 00:15:41.470
I'm surprised they're okay
without hydrating first.

00:15:41.880 --> 00:15:44.000
Let's just head back to the room now.

00:15:44.330 --> 00:15:45.560
Don't worry about me.

00:15:45.560 --> 00:15:48.200
Why don't you and Soumei-san go ahead?

00:15:53.310 --> 00:15:54.920
The water's great.

00:15:54.920 --> 00:15:55.800
Total letdown!

00:15:56.510 --> 00:16:00.420
They allow you to wear a
bath towel at this resort.

00:16:00.420 --> 00:16:02.770
I don't think that's what they meant.

00:16:03.020 --> 00:16:04.490
Oh, just have a drink.

00:16:04.490 --> 00:16:06.320
But we're underage.

00:16:06.320 --> 00:16:09.320
That's why there's goat's
milk for children like you.

00:16:10.140 --> 00:16:11.610
Mr. Goat's milk...?

00:16:12.690 --> 00:16:15.030
You just thought of something
innappropriate, didn't you?

00:16:15.030 --> 00:16:16.150
Gazing at the Don with
such wicked eyes!

00:16:16.150 --> 00:16:17.100
Yata! Have a drink!
Gazing at the Don with
such wicked eyes!

00:16:17.100 --> 00:16:18.560
I knew you liked the Don!
Yata! Have a drink!

00:16:18.560 --> 00:16:19.790
Calm down, Lorenzo!

00:16:20.110 --> 00:16:22.130
Wow, so it's a mixed bath!

00:16:23.340 --> 00:16:26.070
Since it's an outdoor bath,
it is a mixed bath, it is.

00:16:26.070 --> 00:16:28.030
I'm happy we're all together.

00:16:28.030 --> 00:16:30.770
Looks like it was a bit
too intense for Yataro.

00:16:30.770 --> 00:16:32.050
He's a closet pervert, he is.

00:16:32.570 --> 00:16:34.170
We do this every year

00:16:34.170 --> 00:16:36.400
to strengthen our bond.

00:16:36.950 --> 00:16:40.470
You're kind of cute for getting nervous.

00:16:42.740 --> 00:16:43.590
Why don't you...

00:16:43.590 --> 00:16:44.480
tell me why...

00:16:44.480 --> 00:16:46.600
you have no reaction to me?!

00:16:46.600 --> 00:16:47.250
Yata!
you have no reaction to me?!

00:16:47.250 --> 00:16:47.450
Yata!

00:16:47.450 --> 00:16:48.760
You're turning the hot
springs red, you are!
Yata!

00:16:48.760 --> 00:16:49.270
You're turning the hot
springs red, you are!

00:16:49.790 --> 00:16:51.120
What's going on?

00:16:51.120 --> 00:16:54.750
Come now, stop.
You're disturbing the other guests.

00:16:54.750 --> 00:16:57.490
I apologize for the ones with me.
Please, have a drink.

00:16:57.490 --> 00:16:59.380
Oh, well thank y—

00:17:00.500 --> 00:17:01.750
Wolf!

00:17:01.910 --> 00:17:03.120
Damn you, Goat!

00:17:08.580 --> 00:17:10.710
Let's warm up first.

00:17:10.710 --> 00:17:12.300
It cannot be helped.

00:17:12.730 --> 00:17:14.300
Whoa, everyone's here!

00:17:14.300 --> 00:17:15.630
So your assistants are here, as well.

00:17:16.460 --> 00:17:18.890
There's a goat that resembles the
Legionella bacterium in there...

00:17:18.890 --> 00:17:21.290
No matter how you look at it, it should
be a Don that looks like a goat!

00:17:24.350 --> 00:17:27.960
That... is... a...
guy... you... ass...

00:17:27.960 --> 00:17:28.890
So that's why it's red...

00:17:28.890 --> 00:17:29.720
Yata!
So that's why it's red...

00:17:29.720 --> 00:17:30.140
Yata!

00:17:30.140 --> 00:17:30.840
It's been a while since I've
taken a bath with you, Nii-ni.
Yata!

00:17:30.840 --> 00:17:32.770
It's been a while since I've
taken a bath with you, Nii-ni.

00:17:32.770 --> 00:17:34.590
Can you get in without
your shampoo hat now?

00:17:34.590 --> 00:17:35.670
He had one of those?

00:17:36.460 --> 00:17:38.980
Hey, Goat. Let's call a truce for today.

00:17:38.980 --> 00:17:41.160
Let me settle things with Haruka.

00:17:41.360 --> 00:17:43.670
Today is a pleasure trip, it is.

00:17:43.670 --> 00:17:45.960
There will be no blood and guts today.

00:17:49.960 --> 00:17:52.280
Since we want to avoid blood
and guts, how about we do

00:17:52.280 --> 00:17:54.590
that one thing that is
done at hot springs?

00:17:55.570 --> 00:17:56.840
What thing?

00:17:59.180 --> 00:17:59.970
Let's do this, Kei!

00:17:59.970 --> 00:18:00.720
Me?!

00:18:01.260 --> 00:18:03.680
If I win, you'll hand over Haruka.

00:18:04.040 --> 00:18:04.770
Sure!

00:18:05.050 --> 00:18:06.790
What are you going to do if you lose?

00:18:08.110 --> 00:18:11.190
Of course, you'll listen
to my request, right?

00:18:11.860 --> 00:18:14.430
We'll be sleeping in the
same futon tonight.

00:18:14.780 --> 00:18:17.910
Oh, you're still a sweet little child.
Of course I will.

00:18:17.910 --> 00:18:19.740
Exactly where was the
sweetness in that face?!

00:18:19.980 --> 00:18:21.800
The two of you had better win.

00:18:22.230 --> 00:18:24.200
The pressure is a bit
frightening, Haruka-san.

00:18:24.760 --> 00:18:28.230
Don't lose, Kei-kun.
But don't win, either.

00:18:28.230 --> 00:18:31.420
Don't complain like that
until you've lost all hope.

00:18:31.850 --> 00:18:34.380
All right, start the match.

00:18:47.160 --> 00:18:49.770
You totally have experience in this! No fair!

00:18:49.770 --> 00:18:52.230
We're amateurs! Don't we get a handicap?!

00:18:52.490 --> 00:18:53.710
Nice job, Yataro.

00:18:54.050 --> 00:18:54.690
Yataro?!

00:18:55.190 --> 00:18:56.450
The guy who appeared like a comet,

00:18:56.450 --> 00:18:58.820
conquered the National Japanese
Junior Table Tennis Tournament,

00:18:58.820 --> 00:19:01.500
then disappeared into oblivion,
the Ping Pong Prince, Oh Yataro?!

00:19:01.500 --> 00:19:04.160
I heard that he was in China,
but could it be that you're...

00:19:06.230 --> 00:19:07.400
He's saying not a chance.

00:19:08.160 --> 00:19:09.160
Oh...

00:19:09.160 --> 00:19:11.530
Very interesting, Oh Yataro.

00:19:13.080 --> 00:19:13.780
It's the retort. When he retorts,
his true powers come out.

00:19:13.780 --> 00:19:17.320
Yay! I did it!
It's the retort. When he retorts,
his true powers come out.

00:19:17.750 --> 00:19:19.900
Yuuta! Would you please
play the funny man?

00:19:20.270 --> 00:19:21.470
At this rate, we're going
to lose miserably.

00:19:22.700 --> 00:19:25.350
I can't. I usually play the straight man.

00:19:25.350 --> 00:19:27.060
First I've heard of that!

00:19:30.220 --> 00:19:31.990
The sea of blood was
beautiful, wasn't it?

00:19:31.990 --> 00:19:33.230
Looked just like autumn leaves.

00:19:33.230 --> 00:19:35.690
I don't like the opposite, either,
but I'll take the opposite!

00:19:35.690 --> 00:19:37.050
You totally went to the
art gallery, didn't you?

00:19:37.050 --> 00:19:38.360
Even though you're Kei-kun.

00:19:38.360 --> 00:19:40.390
I'm rather broad-minded, you know!

00:19:40.390 --> 00:19:42.320
Add two more letters to Hakone and
you get "hakoneko" <i>(box cat)</i>.

00:19:42.320 --> 00:19:43.660
I love Hakone!

00:19:43.660 --> 00:19:45.530
Hakone read backwards
is "Nekoha" <i>(cat lover)</i>.

00:19:45.530 --> 00:19:46.780
Meow, meow, meow!

00:19:49.110 --> 00:19:52.210
Kei-kun, the black egg
I got you as a gift...

00:19:53.160 --> 00:19:54.490
just hatched.

00:19:55.880 --> 00:19:58.920
Mysterious egg skin!

00:19:59.320 --> 00:20:02.870
Wow! Both teams only
need one more point!

00:20:05.940 --> 00:20:08.220
Just a little more!
It's up to you, Yuuta!

00:20:10.020 --> 00:20:11.520
You ran out of jokes?!

00:20:12.250 --> 00:20:13.850
Yuuta-kun!
I'm conflicted...

00:20:14.070 --> 00:20:14.830
Hey! Come on, Yuuta-kun,
tell more jokes.

00:20:14.830 --> 00:20:18.090
If Haruka comes back, Inaba-san will
return to being a police dog.

00:20:18.090 --> 00:20:19.100
Please!

00:20:19.100 --> 00:20:20.260
Even if we lose, Haruka
will disobey Inaba-san.

00:20:20.260 --> 00:20:21.630
Can you hear me?

00:20:21.630 --> 00:20:21.650
Neither scenario will
work for Yuuta-kun.

00:20:21.650 --> 00:20:22.660
That felt great, it did...

00:20:22.660 --> 00:20:23.120
Neither scenario will
work for Yuuta-kun.

00:20:23.120 --> 00:20:24.300
Yuuta-kun, please? Please?!

00:20:24.300 --> 00:20:26.770
I want to arrest Haruka, too, but...

00:20:27.080 --> 00:20:27.120
Come on!

00:20:27.120 --> 00:20:29.500
Well, there's no real harm if we lose,

00:20:29.500 --> 00:20:31.770
and it'll make the brother
complex brothers happy.

00:20:35.210 --> 00:20:37.290
This isn't good. Kei lost his spark.

00:20:37.560 --> 00:20:39.000
Now, Yataro!

00:20:40.640 --> 00:20:42.450
We just need one more point!

00:20:42.840 --> 00:20:45.200
Someone! Someone give
Kei some strength!

00:20:45.480 --> 00:20:47.740
Someone say something stupid that
Kei won't be able to ignore!

00:20:48.300 --> 00:20:50.030
Everyone be quiet for a while.

00:20:50.030 --> 00:20:52.310
It wouldn't be good if he
started retorting again.

00:20:52.310 --> 00:20:55.170
We have absolutely no
relation with jokes.

00:20:55.170 --> 00:20:57.400
So there's nothing for him to retort.

00:20:58.810 --> 00:21:02.610
Your very existence is a joke!

00:21:15.040 --> 00:21:17.920
Out of bounds.
The terrorist team wins.

00:21:19.210 --> 00:21:20.670
That wasn't on purpose!

00:21:20.670 --> 00:21:23.620
Yay! Read me a book before bedtime!

00:21:23.620 --> 00:21:26.550
What? The Wolf is coming to our room?

00:21:26.550 --> 00:21:28.640
I'm going over there?

00:21:29.000 --> 00:21:31.640
That means you guys are
coming, too, right?

00:21:31.930 --> 00:21:34.800
Yeah! Yeah! Today is a truce!

00:21:34.800 --> 00:21:35.130
The Tortoise and the Hare
Yeah! Yeah! Today is a truce!

00:21:35.130 --> 00:21:37.770
The Tortoise and the Hare

00:21:37.770 --> 00:21:39.770
Hakone

00:21:41.810 --> 00:21:44.920
Next time, I'm thinking about killing
the cop with poisonous gas.

00:21:44.920 --> 00:21:46.060
Why is everyone so
energetic at this hour?
Sarin gas?

00:21:46.060 --> 00:21:48.660
Why is everyone so
energetic at this hour?

00:21:48.660 --> 00:21:50.000
You'll pay for that!

00:21:50.000 --> 00:21:52.070
That is my line, it is!

00:23:27.080 --> 00:23:30.050
All right! Next time on
<i>Cuticle Detective Inaba</i>...

00:23:30.200 --> 00:23:31.140
Hi, it's me, Hiroshi.

00:23:31.140 --> 00:23:32.560
Whoa, what's with that guy?

00:23:32.560 --> 00:23:34.320
Did he always look so evil?

00:23:34.320 --> 00:23:36.390
Looks like there's a lot going on.

00:23:36.390 --> 00:23:39.280
All right. Go wash your hair
and be ready for next week!

00:23:39.280 --> 00:23:41.190
This week's preview is totally normal!
